   local="Patiala is a city of large old homes and planned estates. Model Town, Urban Estate and the Bhupindra Road side have independent houses with gardens and plenty of furniture, while the walled old city has narrow bazaars where a truck cannot enter. University and college staff, doctors and government employees make up a good share of moves, often between Patiala and Chandigarh or Delhi. Summers are hot and the monsoon is heavy, so we pack wood and fabric against heat and wet.",
