         ("Can a car go from Ludhiana to Mumbai with my household goods?","Yes, on a separate carrier. Mumbai is more than 1,500 km away, so a sedan is roughly Rs 15,000 to 25,000 plus GST and an SUV roughly Rs 20,000 to 34,000 plus GST."),
         ("How long does a Ludhiana to Bengaluru move take?","After loading, a truck usually takes about five to seven days to reach Bengaluru, and the expected delivery dates are written on your plan."),
