   intro="VRL Packers and Movers Jalandhar is still a common search for people across the Doaba region, and we answer it as 1st VRL Packers and Movers. Jalandhar is about 150 km from our Panchkula head office; a verified partner team does the work here, and one Panchkula coordinator manages it.",
   local="Jalandhar has a mix of planned colonies like Model Town, Urban Estate and Defence Colony, crowded older areas around Rama Mandi and Basti Sheikh, and the cantonment on the city edge. Many families here have members abroad, so moves often include closing up a large house, sending part of the goods to a relative and storing the rest. The city is also known for its sports goods and leather industry, and staff of these units move in and out regularly.",
   areas=["Model Town","Urban Estate","Defence Colony","Lajpat Nagar","Guru Teg Bahadur Nagar","Adarsh Nagar","Mota Singh Nagar","Basti Sheikh","Rama Mandi","Jalandhar Cantt","Focal Point","Nakodar Road"],
