   local="Amritsar has two very different kinds of move. The walled city around the Golden Temple has narrow, crowded lanes where no truck can enter, so goods are carried by hand or a small vehicle to the nearest open road. Outside the walls, colonies such as Ranjit Avenue, Green Avenue and Basant Avenue have wide roads and independent houses that are easy to load. The cantonment also brings service transfers, and most long-distance trucks leave the city on the highway towards Jalandhar.",
