   routes=["Malout to Chandigarh","Malout to Bathinda","Malout to Ludhiana","Malout to Delhi","Malout to Jaipur","Malout to Hyderabad"],
   example="A 2 BHK on the Abohar Road moving to Ludhiana, about 190 km by road, is in the up to 500 km band at roughly Rs 13,000 to 24,000 plus GST. A 3 BHK going to Hyderabad, more than 1,500 km away, is roughly Rs 34,000 to 60,000 plus GST.",
   photos=["crew/crew-carton-taping", "sp/sp-loading-720", "sp/sp-home-packing-720"],
   more=[("Students and staff at the institutes",
          ["MIMIT and the colleges in town draw students and teachers from across Punjab, and moves peak when terms begin and end. A hostel room or a rented single room goes in a small vehicle on the 1 RK band, and the partner team brings cartons and tape, so students do not have to hunt for packing material.",
           "Lecturers and staff on transfer usually move a full house. The coordinator asks for the date you must leave, sets packing for the day before, and writes the estimate after a video call, so the price is known before the partner team arrives."]),
         ("Cotton country and house size",
          ["Cotton picking starts around October, and the ginning factories around Malout work long hours into the winter. Families in the trade often prefer to move once the season ends, so booking a week or two ahead helps if you are aiming for those weeks.",
           "Farmhouses and large town homes here hold heavy wooden beds, steel trunks and years of stored goods. The survey lists every room before the price is written. Farm produce, fuel and machinery are not carried, but hand tools, trunks and sewing machines can go with the household."])],
