         ("Is Malout to Abohar priced as local?","No. Abohar is in Fazilka district, about 32 km away, so the move is on the up to 500 km band. A 1 BHK is roughly Rs 9,500 to 17,000 plus GST."),
         ("Can you move a house within Malout?","Yes. Moves inside Malout and to the villages close to it are on the local band. A 2 BHK is roughly Rs 8,000 to 15,000 plus GST."),
