   example="A 2 BHK on the Rohtak Road moving to Gurugram, about 110 km by road, is in the up to 500 km band at roughly Rs 13,000 to 24,000 plus GST. A 1 BHK moved between two colonies inside Gohana is a local move of roughly Rs 5,000 to 9,000 plus GST.",
